{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"29":"Medicine (Kitab Al-Tibb)"},"section_detail":{"29":{"hadithnumber_first":3855,"hadithnumber_last":3903,"arabicnumber_first":3855,"arabicnumber_last":3903,"name_native":"كتاب الطب"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3864,"arabicnumber":3864,"text":"حدثنا محمد بن سليمان الانباري، حدثنا ابو معاوية، عن الاعمش، عن ابي سفيان، عن جابر، قال بعث النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم الى ابى طبيبا فقطع منه عرقا","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Muslim (2207)"}],"reference":{"book":29,"hadith":10}}]}